1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,002
Security fills in the Search List and hands you the phone.

2
00:00:04,452 --> 00:00:08,406
This guide is for staff or workmen being searched, and witnesses.

3
00:00:09,156 --> 00:00:10,480
Here is what changed.

4
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:14,895
Before, this was a printed paper form, signed with a pen.

5
00:00:15,695 --> 00:00:19,537
Now it is the same form, on the Security officer’s phone.

6
00:00:19,986 --> 00:00:25,352
You sign with your finger, and the signed PDF is saved automatically, in a

7
00:00:25,352 --> 00:00:27,237
restricted AirAsia folder.

8
00:00:28,037 --> 00:00:30,056
Every form works in four steps.

9
00:00:30,506 --> 00:00:33,618
Security fills the form, and hands you the phone.

10
00:00:34,068 --> 00:00:36,733
You check, type your name and ID, and sign.

11
00:00:37,533 --> 00:00:40,861
Then the phone goes back, and Security signs and saves.

12
00:00:41,311 --> 00:00:42,607
Blue is Security.

13
00:00:43,057 --> 00:00:44,121
Orange is you.

14
00:00:44,871 --> 00:00:47,609
You need nothing to install, and no account.

15
00:00:48,059 --> 00:00:49,756
Security brings the phone.

16
00:00:50,206 --> 00:00:53,366
Have your own name and ID or staff number ready.

17
00:00:54,166 --> 00:00:57,764
Read the form before you sign, and if it is wrong, say so.

18
00:00:58,564 --> 00:01:00,181
Sign only for yourself.

19
00:01:00,931 --> 00:01:05,053
This part is for the person searched, and the witness, if one is present.

20
00:01:05,503 --> 00:01:08,309
It is the same flow as FOCA and NOTOC.

21
00:01:09,109 --> 00:01:11,190
This is the paper form we used.

22
00:01:11,640 --> 00:01:13,349
Security fills the form.

23
00:01:14,949 --> 00:01:17,460
In the app, the person searched signs first.

24
00:01:18,260 --> 00:01:20,925
The witness signs second, only if present.

25
00:01:21,725 --> 00:01:23,635
Then the Security staff who searched.

26
00:01:24,835 --> 00:01:29,368
Check the items found are listed correctly, or ‘Nil’, before you sign.

27
00:01:31,168 --> 00:01:34,412
Check it is your turn: the orange box shows your name.

28
00:01:36,012 --> 00:01:39,619
Scroll up and read the search details and the items found.

29
00:01:41,819 --> 00:01:44,596
If nothing was found, the form should say ‘Nil’.

30
00:01:45,396 --> 00:01:48,765
If anything is wrong, tell Security before you sign.

31
00:01:50,365 --> 00:01:53,128
If everything is correct, sign with your finger.

32
00:01:54,528 --> 00:01:56,541
Tap ‘Clear’ if you need to sign again.

33
00:01:57,341 --> 00:01:58,690
Then tap ‘Confirm’.

34
00:02:00,390 --> 00:02:06,049
If a witness is present, they do the same: check their own name, sign, and tap ‘Confirm’.

35
00:02:08,149 --> 00:02:11,481
When the screen says so, give the phone back to Security.

36
00:02:12,831 --> 00:02:15,337
Security signs and saves the record.

37
00:02:16,137 --> 00:02:18,913
This is a real Saved screen from a TEST record.

38
00:02:19,363 --> 00:02:24,501
The app creates the signed PDF, and the Record ID is in the file name.

39
00:02:25,951 --> 00:02:29,776
Security staff email you a copy of the signed Search List.

40
00:02:30,576 --> 00:02:31,936
Keep it for your records.

41
00:02:32,736 --> 00:02:37,828
Remember: check your name and role on screen, and read the details before signing.

42
00:02:38,628 --> 00:02:40,881
Type your own name and ID if asked.

43
00:02:41,681 --> 00:02:46,312
Sign with your finger, then Confirm, and hand the phone back to Security.

44
00:02:47,112 --> 00:02:50,558
Don’t sign for someone else, or if the details are wrong.

45
00:02:51,358 --> 00:02:55,016
Don’t close the app, press Back, or take photos of the screen.

46
00:02:55,766 --> 00:03:02,432
Your signature goes into one signed PDF per form, with every signature and a Record ID.

47
00:03:02,882 --> 00:03:07,149
It is saved to a restricted AirAsia folder, with a record log.

48
00:03:07,599 --> 00:03:12,238
A PDF copy of the signed Search List is shared with you by email.

49
00:03:13,288 --> 00:03:14,344
Have a question?

50
00:03:14,794 --> 00:03:16,834
Ask the Security staff on duty.

